<title>FRANCE: Rouen April flour exports detailed.</title>
<headline>Rouen April flour exports detailed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen declined to 61,285 tonnes in April 1997 from 63,000 in April 1996, French port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>April 1997 exports included 24,280 tonnes for West Africa, 3,000 for Algeria, 11,025 for Cuba, 3,000 for Russia and 19,980 tonnes for Yemen, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
